            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "So... now resizing the tmux pane left/right (and up/down) also resizes nvim properly, with both 0.12.4 and the latest nightly, using both rootshell and iTerm2.\n\nI'm not 100% sure what's different between now and when I originally submitted this issue, but I did end up reinstalling tmux and making some changes to .tmux.conf over the past few days.\n\nOn a related note, zooming the tmux pane does not trigger a resize with nvim, with both 0.12.4 and the latest nightly. Based on what just happened, this might be more likely a tmux issue than a nvim issue?\n\nThanks for your help and sorry for the mix-up. Happy to close this, unless you think there might still be a nvim bug here.",
